                              [--prefix-lengths PREFIX_LENGTHS]
                              [--layers LAYERS] [--token-region TOKEN_REGION]
                              [--device DEVICE] [--dtype DTYPE]
                              [--condition CONDITION] [--run-name RUN_NAME]
                              [--overwrite] [--error-jsonl ERROR_JSONL]
                              [--store-text-hashes]

Stage 6 token-level delayed detection. Writes compact prefix projection
summaries only; never writes raw prompt text, response text, token strings,
logits, or hidden states.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input-jsonl INPUT_JSONL
  --direction-path DIRECTION_PATH
  --model-name-or-path MODEL_NAME_OR_PATH
  --output-jsonl OUTPUT_JSONL
  --summary-json SUMMARY_JSON
  --max-examples MAX_EXAMPLES
  --max-length MAX_LENGTH
  --prefix-lengths PREFIX_LENGTHS
  --layers LAYERS       HuggingFace hidden-state indices to project. 0 is
                        embeddings, 1 is the first transformer block output,
                        -1 is the final hidden state. Use comma lists like
                        '0,-1' or '1,12,-1'. Use 'all' to project every
                        hidden-state index.
  --token-region TOKEN_REGION
                        Comma-separated token regions. Supported:
                        all,final_token,first_32,last_16,last_32,last_8.
  --device DEVICE
  --dtype DTYPE
  --condition CONDITION
                        Default condition label for input rows that do not
                        already contain a condition.
  --run-name RUN_NAME
  --overwrite
  --error-jsonl ERROR_JSONL
  --store-text-hashes   Store SHA256 hashes of prompt text only; never stores
                        raw text.

